                        "entry_id": "75cb6ee8-fa71-3cd8-ad56-d56aebb7a490",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A musical instrument, a shaker, made of a hollow gourd with parallel notches cut in one side, and played by rubbing a stick or scraper (\\\"pua\\\") along the notches to produce a ratchet-like sound."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef21c86b-e23e-42df-831e-b5cedf614d21",
                                "sense_id": "b48632b1-1397-3ae5-ae79-1327911aa112",
                                "text": "The house band consisted of gigantic guitars, fiddles, trumpets, and accordion, with rhythms provided by a batería including timbales, guiros, and congas."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ac939666-4cb9-35b9-a40d-fb54562056ba",
                        "entry_id": "75cb6ee8-fa71-3cd8-ad56-d56aebb7a490",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A genre of traditional Cuban music, used in santería rituals."
                        ],
